ZERO speech layer / first adapter

The semantic event stream is canonical.
Speech is only a consumer.

Requirements:
  interruptible announcements
  deterministic event ordering
  no parsing of synthesized audio
  no OCR
  no dependency on an external screen reader
  speech failure must not destroy semantic state

Current implementation target:
  browser-core/zero_reader.c

Next:
  replace diagnostic output with an actual platform speech backend,
  while preserving the exact semantic event interface.
